cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If uPrime contributes to your research, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
title: "uPrime: Open-source software for velocity field and turbulence analysis from PIV and CFD data"
abstract: >-
  uPrime is a standalone desktop application for post-processing and turbulence
  analysis of velocity field data from particle image velocimetry (PIV) and
  computational fluid dynamics (CFD). It provides a graphical interface for
  Reynolds stresses, TKE budgets, spectra, correlations, POD, DMD, vortex
  identification and probability analysis without requiring any scripting.
